---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../components/SectionHeader.astro';
import FeeBreakdown from '../components/FeeBreakdown.astro';
import Callout from '../components/Callout.astro';
import LegalNotice from '../components/LegalNotice.astro';
import ReviewNote from '../components/ReviewNote.astro';
import { fees, usd } from '../config/site';
const crumbs = [{ label: 'Membership', href: '/membership/' }, { label: 'Contributions & fees', href: '/contributions-fees/' }];
---
<PageLayout
  title="Contributions &amp; fees"
  description="Club Pamoja fees and contributions: $20 application fee, $60 one-time activation fee, $90 contribution following the death of a member, and $30 following the death of an eligible registered family member."
  eyebrow="Membership"
  lede="Every amount is fixed and published in advance. There are two one-off fees to join, and two set contribution amounts when the community is called."
  breadcrumbs={crumbs}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <FeeBreakdown detailed headingLevel="h2" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split">
        <div class="split__head"><p class="eyebrow">Summary</p><h2>All amounts at a glance.</h2></div>
        <div>
          <div class="table-wrap" role="region" aria-label="Fees and contributions table" tabindex="0">
            <table class="table">
              <caption>Club Pamoja fees and contributions (USD)</caption>
              <thead><tr><th scope="col">Item</th><th scope="col">When</th><th scope="col">Amount</th></tr></thead>
              <tbody>
                <tr><th scope="row">Application fee</th><td>When you apply</td><td class="num">{usd(fees.application)}</td></tr>
                <tr><th scope="row">Activation fee</th><td>Once, to activate membership</td><td class="num">{usd(fees.activation)}</td></tr>
                <tr><th scope="row">Member bereavement contribution</th><td>Following the death of a member</td><td class="num">{usd(fees.memberContribution)}</td></tr>
                <tr><th scope="row">Family bereavement contribution</th><td>Following the death of an eligible registered family member</td><td class="num">{usd(fees.familyContribution)}</td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="contributions">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split">
        <div class="split__head"><p class="eyebrow">Contributions</p><h2>When the community is called.</h2></div>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>A contribution is each member’s share in supporting a member family after a death. It is called following a death.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Following the death of a <strong>member</strong>, each member is called to contribute <strong>{usd(fees.memberContribution)}</strong>.</li>
            <li>Following the death of an <strong>eligible registered family member</strong>, each member is called to contribute <strong>{usd(fees.familyContribution)}</strong>.</li>
          </ul>
          <Callout title="Contributions are not premiums">
            <p>Club Pamoja is mutual aid, not insurance. A contribution does not buy coverage. It is your part in a shared commitment among members.</p>
          </Callout>
          <h3>How you are notified and how you pay</h3>
          <p>Members are informed when a contribution is called.</p>
          <ReviewNote id="CR-10">Add: how members are notified, payment methods, the deadline to contribute, and what happens if a contribution is missed, all from the bylaws.</ReviewNote>
          <Callout tone="obligation" title="Your obligation">
            <p>Contributing when called is a condition of membership. Specific deadlines and the consequences of non-payment are set out in the <a href="/bylaws/">bylaws</a>.</p>
          </Callout>
          <LegalNotice />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--alt" id="fees">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split">
        <div class="split__head"><p class="eyebrow">Joining fees</p><h2>Application and activation.</h2></div>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>The <strong>{usd(fees.application)} application fee</strong> is paid when you apply. The <strong>{usd(fees.activation)} activation fee</strong> is paid once, to activate your membership.</p>
          <ReviewNote id="CR-13">Confirm whether either fee is refundable (e.g. if an application is not approved), and what each fee funds.</ReviewNote>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageLayout>
